{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<style type=\"text/css\">/*------------------- common --------------------*/\r\n.product_detail_page h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n.product_detail_page .clear:after{clear:both;content:'''';display:block;}\r\n.product_detail_page *{box-sizing: border-box;}\r\n.product_detail_page ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}\r\n.product_detail_page {width: 100%;max-width:1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; font-family: ''Noto Sans KR'', sans-serif;text-align: center;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: -0.05em;word-break: keep-all;}\r\n.product_detail_page p {color: #666;font-weight: 300;font-size: 1.7em;}\r\n.product_detail_page p span {color: #333;font-weight: 500;}\r\n.product_detail_page p.sub_p {width: 80%;margin: 0 auto;margin-bottom: 3%;}\r\n.product_detail_page h5 {font-family: sans-serif;font-weight: 500;font-size: 25px;text-transform: uppercase;color: #fff;display: inline;background-color: #c3d433;padding: 0 0.7%;}\r\n.product_detail_page .h5_bar {width: 2%;margin: 0 auto;border-bottom: 3px solid #70abff;position: absolute;left: 50%;bottom: 0;transform: translateX(-50%);z-index: 0;line-height: 1;opacity: 25%;}\r\n.product_detail_page h2 {display:inline-block;font-weight: 600;font-size: 60px;text-align: center;color: #fff;margin: 0 auto;margin-top: 0.5em;margin-bottom: 3%; /*3%*/letter-spacing: -1px;position:relative}\r\n.product_detail_page h2 span {font-weight: 300;color:#000;}\r\n.product_detail_page h3 {font-weight: 600;font-size: 50px;text-align: center;color: #000;width: 90%;margin: 0 auto;margin-top: 1%;margin-bottom: 3%; /*3%*/}\r\n.product_detail_page h3 span {font-weight: 300;}\r\n.product_detail_page img {max-width: 100%;}\r\n.product_detail_page .tit-desc{line-height:1.4;font-weight:300;color:#333}\r\n.product_detail_page .tit-desc .highlight{border-bottom:1px solid #666666;color:#333;font-weight:600}\r\n.product_detail_page .tit-desc .text1{font-size:3.2em;font-weight:500}\r\n.product_detail_page .tit-desc .text2{color:#2b210c;font-size:5.7em;font-weight:100}\r\n.product_detail_page .section {width: 100%;margin: 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;}\r\n\r\n/**브랜드스토리**/\r\n.brand_story .point_tit {color: #000;font-size:60px;font-weight: 700;text-align: center;margin-top: 1%;}\r\n.brand_story .point_tit span { font-weight: 400;}\r\n.brand_story {width: 95%;height: auto;border: 1px solid #b1b1b1;margin: 0 auto;margin-top: 8%;/*margin-bottom: 8%;*/padding-bottom: 2%;}\r\n.brand_story .rounded {width: 200px;background-color: #403025;border:2px solid #000;padding:0.1em 1em;border-radius: 3em;-moz-border-radius: 3em;-webkit-border-radius: 3em;color: #fff;margin: 0 auto;font-size: 1.2em;line-height: 1.2em;margin-top: -1.7%;text-align: center;}\r\n.brand_story .content {width: 93%;margin: 0 auto;text-align: left;margin-top: 3%;margin-bottom: 3%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .img, .brand_story .content .text {display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;}\r\n.brand_story .content .img {width: 50%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .img img { width: 100%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .text { text-align: left;width: 45%;margin-left: 3%;word-break: keep-all;}\r\n.brand_story .brand_logo { width: 40%;}\r\n.brand_story .brand_logo img {width: 100%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .bd {width: 8%;height: 2px;background-color: #666;margin-top: 5%;}\r\n.brand_story .content .text p {color: #666;font-size: 22px;font-weight: 300;margin-top: 3%;line-height:1.6}\r\n.brand_story .content .text p span {font-weight: 500;}\r\n.brand_story .content .text p.subject{font-size:60px;color:#000;margin-top:0;font-weight:600}\r\n.brand_story .content .text p.bold{color: #333;font-weight: 600;font-size:24px;}\r\n\r\n/**건강 정보**/\r\n.health_information {width: 100%;padding: 7% 0;}\r\n.health_information .hinfo_info_tit {width: 95%;margin: 0 auto;}\r\n.hinfo_info_subject {position: relative;}\r\n.hinfo_info_subject h2 {width: 100%;position: absolute;top: 50%;left: 50%;transform: translate(-50%, -50%);font-size: 60px;font-weight: 700;text-align: center;text-transform: uppercase;color: #fff;}\r\n.hinfo_info_subject h2 span {font-size: 30px;color:#fff;}\r\n.health_information .content {width:95%;margin: 0 auto;padding-top: 5%;}\r\n\r\n/**각종인증사항**/\r\n.certifications {width: 100%;padding-top: 3%; /*10%*/padding-bottom: 8%;margin-bottom: 8%;}\r\n.certifications .certifi_info_tit {width: 95%;margin: 0 auto;}\r\n.certifi_info_subject {position: relative;}\r\n.certifi_info_subject h2 {font-size: 60px;font-weight: 700;text-align: center;position: absolute;color: #fff;margin:0;width: 100%;top:50%;transform: translateY(-50%);}\r\n.certifi_info_subject h2 span.light {font-weight:300;color:#fff;}\r\n.certifi_info_subject h2 span.sm-text {font-size: 30px;color:#fff;display:block;}\r\n.certifications img {width: 100%;}\r\n.certifi_info_content img {}\r\n.certifi_01 {width: 90%;margin: 0 auto;text-align: left;margin-top: 5%;}\r\n.certifi_01 .certifi_01_img {display: inline-block;}\r\n.certifications h5 {font-size: 25px;font-weight: 700;color: #000;background: none;display: block;padding: 0;position: relative;opacity: 1;text-transform: none;}\r\n.certifications h6 {font-size: 22px;font-weight: 700;color: #333;margin-top: 1.2%;display: inline-block;}\r\n.certifications h6 span {border-bottom: 1px solid #c1c1c1;}\r\n.certifications p {font-size: 16px!important;color: #555;line-height: 24px;margin-top: 1.5%;}\r\n.certifi_01_content {display: inline-block;width: 80%;margin-left: 2.5%;vertical-align: top;}\r\n\r\n/*common-sectionnumber(circle)*/\t\r\n.product_detail_page .section-num{position:relative;margin:1% 0}\r\n.product_detail_page .section-num:before{content:'''';position:absolute;top:50%;left:5%;transform:translateY(-50%);height:2px;width:36%;background-color:#333;}\r\n.product_detail_page .section-num:after{content:'''';position:absolute;top:50%;right:5%;transform:translateY(-50%);height:2px;width:36%;background-color:#333;}\r\n.product_detail_page .section-num .round {display: inline-block;width: 125px;height: 125px;border: 2px solid #333333;border-radius: 75px;-moz-border-radius: 75px;-webkit-border-radius: 75px;margin: 0 auto;text-align: center;text-transform: uppercase;position:relative;}\r\n.product_detail_page .section-num .round p {font-size: 20px;color: #333333;line-height: 30px;position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -50%);width:100%}\r\n.product_detail_page .section-num .round p span {font-size: 32px;font-weight: 700;color: #333333;font-family: sans-serif;}\r\n/*----------------- section -----------------*/\r\n.product_detail_page{color:#000}\r\n.product_detail_page .content .title{font-size:34px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:300;color:#000;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px;}\r\n.product_detail_page .content .title span{font-weight:300}\r\n.product_detail_page .content .sm-title{font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:300;color:#333}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n/*---------------------------------- custom content ----------------------------------*/\r\n.product_detail_page p {font-size: 2em;color:#000}\r\n/* section-title */\r\n.product_detail_page .title-sub-container{}\r\n.product_detail_page .title-sub-container h5{z-index: 1;position: relative;font-size: 1.8em;font-weight:400;text-transform: uppercase;display: inline-block;\r\ncolor: #fff;background-color:#dfa573;\r\npadding:0 0.5em;margin-bottom:1em;}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.product_detail_page .title-container{position:relative}\r\n.product_detail_page .title-container h2 {font-size:4.5em;min-width:250px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 0.3em;color:#000;letter-spacing: -3px;}\r\n.product_detail_page .title-container h2 span{color:#000;}\r\n.product_detail_page .line-block{border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd;width:87%;margin:0 auto;margin-top:-2px;height:1px}\r\n\r\n\r\n/* 키이미지 */\r\n.product_detail_page .key_img {position: relative;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box {position: absolute;width: 100%;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box.top {position: absolute;width: 100%;top:39%;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_img img {width: 100%;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_label{position:relative;display:inline-block;border:1px solid #000;border-top:none; padding:0.6em 2em 0.4em 2em;font-size:1.8em;min-width:39%;font-weight:300;color:#000}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_label strong{font-weight:500}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_label:before{content:'''';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:1px;width:10%;background:#000;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_label:after{content:'''';position:absolute;right:0;top:0;height:1px;width:10%;background:#000;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_label .label_tit{width:80%;position: absolute;top:0;line-height: 1.2;margin-top: -0.55em;font-size: 0.70em;padding: 0 5px;letter-spacing: 1px;left: 50%;transform: translateX(-50%);font-weight: 500;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit {margin: 0;width:48%;text-align: center;padding:0 5%}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_tit .p01 {margin: 0 auto;color: #343434;font-size: 31px;font-weight: 500;margin-top: 4%;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box .key_tit .p01 span {font-weight: 600;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box h1 {font-weight:400;font-size: 4.0em;letter-spacing: -0.05em;line-height:1.3;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_box h1 span{font-weight:300}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit .sub-tit{font-size:2em;font-weight:300;color:#fff;letter-spacing:0;padding:0;margin: 0.5em 0 0.5em 0;line-height:1.2}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit .sub-tit span{font-weight:400}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc{color:#fff;line-height:1.4}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc .text1:before{content:'''';height:1px;background-color:#b5b5b5;display:block;margin: 0.2em 0 0.2em;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc .text1:after{content:'''';height:1px;background-color:#b5b5b5;display:block;margin: 0.2em 0 0.2em;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc .text1{font-size:3.5em;display:inline-block;font-weight:300;line-height:1.2;margin:0.2em 0;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc .text1 span{font-weight:500}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc .text2{font-size:2.2em;font-weight:300;color:#fff;}\r\n.product_detail_page .key_tit>.tit-desc .text3{font-size:4.2em;font-weight:500;color:#fff;letter-spacing: -5px;}\r\n.product_detail_page .features {width: 100%;margin:5% auto 10%;    position: absolute;    bottom: 0;}\r\n.product_detail_page .features .feature-box {width:20%;display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;padding:0 5%;margin:1% 0;position:relative}\r\n.product_detail_page .features .feature-box:after{content:'''';width:1px;height:36px;position:absolute;top:50%;right:0;margin-top:-18px;background:rgba(000,000,000,0.15)}\r\n.product_detail_page .features .feature-box:nth-child(3):after{content:none;}\r\n.product_detail_page .features .feature-box:last-child:after{content:none;}\r\n.product_detail_page .features .feature-box:last-child {margin-right: 0;}\r\n.product_detail_page .features p {color: #333;font-weight: 300;font-size:1.3em;}\r\n\r\n\r\n/*quantity-info(footer)*/\t\r\n.quantity-info{background-color:#f4f4f4;padding: 7% 5%;}\t\r\n.quantity-info .title-sub-container{padding:1em;background:url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/ingredients-bg.png)no-repeat center center;background-size:contain}\t\r\n.quantity-info .title-sub-container h5::before{content:none;}\r\n.quantity-info .title-sub-container h5{color:#1a1a1a;}\r\n.quantity-info .title-container h2{margin-top:0}\r\n.quantity-info .desc{color:#666;font-size: 1.4em;font-weight: 300;padding-bottom: 5%;}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc{color:#666666;border-top:1px solid #c2c2c2;padding: 0 10%;}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc .tit{color: #333333;margin: 1em;font-size: 2.2em;font-weight: 600;}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul{text-align:left;font-size:1.4em;font-weight:300}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li{position:relative;padding-left:1.2em;margin-bottom:0.5em;}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li span.num{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li>ul{margin-top:0.5em;font-size:0.8em}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li>ul>li{position:relative;padding-left:1.2em;margin-bottom:0.5em;}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li>ul>li:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\r\n.quantity-info .list-type-desc>ul li>ul>li span.num{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;}\r\n\r\n/* point-featured */\r\n.point-featured{padding:5% 6%}\r\n.point-featured .title-container h2 span{font-weight:400}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1{display:inline-block;margin:5% 0;padding:10%;position: relative;}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 img{width:80%}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text{}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li{color:#666;font-weight:300;position:absolute;text-align:center;line-height:1.2;}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li span{background: linear-gradient(to right, #f5d4b2, #edb381);color: #fff;font-size: 2em;font-weight: 400;padding: 0.3em 1em;border-radius: 1em;display:block;margin:0.5em;}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li .text{font-size:2.0em;}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li:nth-child(1){top:0%;left:50%;transform: translateX(-50%);}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li:nth-child(2){top:28%;right:2%}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li:nth-child(3){top:64%;right:3%}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li:nth-child(4){bottom:0%;left:50%;transform: translateX(-50%);}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li:nth-child(5){top:64%;left:3%;}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group1 .label-text li:nth-child(6){top:28%;left:2%}\r\n\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group2{margin:5% 0}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group2 .box-container{background-color:#fff1e4;position:relative;text-align:left;padding:5% 5% 5% 43%}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group2 .box-container img{position:absolute;    left: 5%;top: 50%;transform: translateY(-50%);width: 31%;}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group2 .box-container .text1{font-size:3.2em;font-weight:600;color:#171717;display:inline-block;border-bottom:2px solid #171717}\r\n.point-featured .content .content-desc .group2 .box-container .text2{font-size:3.2em;font-weight:400;color:#262626;margin-top:0.2em}\r\n\r\n/* point01 */\r\n.point01.section{padding:5% 2.5%;}\r\n.point01 .group1{background-color:#f9f9f9;text-align:left;padding:2.5% 5%;margin:5% 0}\r\n.point01 .group1>li{padding:5% 0 5% 7.5%;border-bottom:1px solid #c7c7c7;position:relative}\r\n.point01 .group1>li:last-child{border:none;}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .tit{font-size:3.5em;}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .tit span{position:absolute;left:0;font-weight:500;color:#edb482}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .tit small{font-size:0.6em;}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .desc{margin-top:1em;}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .desc li{font-size:2.0em;margin-bottom:0.3em;font-weight:300;position:relative;padding-left:0.5em}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .desc li:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}\r\n.point01 .group1>li .desc li span{color:#4b4b4b;position:absolute;left:0;font-weight:600}\r\n\r\n/*point02*/\r\n.point02.section{text-align:left;padding:12% 5%;\r\nbackground:url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-04.jpg)no-repeat center center;\r\nbackground-size:cover;}\r\n.point02 h2{text-align:left;}\r\n.point02 .tit-desc{margin-top:2em;}\r\n.point02 .tit-desc p{font-weight:400}\r\n\r\n/*point03*/\r\n.point03.section{text-align:right;padding:12% 5%;\r\nbackground:url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-05.jpg)no-repeat center center;\r\nbackground-size:cover;}\r\n.point03 h2{text-align:right;}\r\n.point03 .tit-desc{margin-top:2em;}\r\n.point03 .tit-desc p{font-weight:400}\r\n\r\n/*point04*/\r\n.point04.section{text-align:left;padding:12% 5%;\r\nbackground:url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-06.jpg)no-repeat center center;\r\nbackground-size:cover;}\r\n.point04 h2{text-align:left;}\r\n.point04 .tit-desc{margin-top:2em;}\r\n.point04 .tit-desc p{font-weight:400}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.section.main_ingredient{}\r\n.section.main_ingredient .title-sub-container h5{color:#333;margin-bottom:0;font-weight:600}\r\n.section.main_ingredient .title-container h2{margin-top:0}\r\n\r\n\r\n/*product-component*/\t\t\r\n.product-components{position:relative;padding:5% 0;}\r\n.product-components .content {padding:5% 10% 0}\r\n.product-components .content ul li{display:inline-block;width:49%}\r\n.product-components .content ul li:nth-child(1) img{width:65%}\r\n.product-components .content ul li:nth-child(2) img{width:21%}\r\n.product-components .content ul li:nth-child(3) {width:80%;margin-top:10%}\r\n.product-components .content ul li .label{position:relative;font-size:1.7em;color:#fff;background-color:#6bc2f0;border-radius: 1.5em;font-weight:300;padding:0.25em;margin-top:1em;display:inline-block;width:10em;height:3em;line-height:1.2}\r\n.product-components .content ul li .label .text{position:absolute;top:50%;transform: translateY(-50%);width:100%;left:0;}\r\n.product-components .content ul li .label .text span{font-weight:500}\r\n\r\n\r\n/* tip-container */\r\n.tip-container{padding:0 2.5%}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc{border:1px solid #b1b1b1;position:relative;padding:5% 7%}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc .tit{color:#c00101;font-size:3.5em;font-weight:600;position:absolute;left:50%;top:-1em;transform: translateX(-50%);background-color:#fff;padding:0 0.5em}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc .tit span{font-style: italic;}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc .desc{font-size:1.7em;color:#555;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:2em;}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc .group1{}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc .group1 li{float:left;width:33.333333%;padding:1em 1.5em;}\r\n.tip-container .content-desc .group1 li img{}\r\n\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_txt.type2{padding-right:15%;position:relative}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_txt.type2 .note{font-size:1em;color:#666;margin-top:0.5em;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_txt.type2 .note .highlight{font-weight:500;color:#333;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_txt.type2 .img-box{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:15%;box-shadow: 1px 1px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n/*----------------- etc-common -----------------*/\r\n/**제품 주요성분**/\r\n.section.main_ingredient{padding:7% 0}\r\n.main_ingredient .content {width: 90%;padding: 2% 0;margin: 0 auto;}\r\n.main_ingredient .title-sub-container h5{background:none;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li{position:relative;text-align: left;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li:after{content: '''';width: 82%;height: 1px;margin: 0 auto;background-color: #e5e5e5;position: absolute;left: 50%;bottom:0;z-index: -1;transform: translateX(-50%);}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li:last-child:after{content:none;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li:nth-child(even){text-align: right;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_img, .ingredient_txt {display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_img {width: 18%;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_img img{width:100%;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_txt {width: 70%;margin-left: 3%;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_txt p {font-size: 20px;font-weight: 300;line-height: 1.6;color: #666666;margin-top: 1.5%;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li:nth-child(even) .ingredient_txt {width: 70%;margin-right: 3%;margin-left:0;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_tit {font-size: 25px;font-weight: 600;color: #403025;display: inline-block;}\r\n.main_ingredient ul li .ingredient_tit span{border-bottom:1px solid}\r\n.main_ingredient .fix_txt {font-size: 20px;font-weight: 400;margin-top: 5%;color:#666;font-weight:300}\r\n/* .main_ingredient ul li:last-child:after{content:none;} */\r\n/**독일 더마테스트**/\r\n.dermatest {width: 100%;padding: 10% 3%;background-color: #f9f9f9;box-sizing: border-box;}\r\n.dermatest .img {width: 17%;margin: 0 auto;}\r\n.dermatest .img img {width: 100%;}\r\n.dermatest h3 {width:100%;font-size:2.7em;font-weight: 600;line-height: 1.5;margin-top: 3%;}\r\n.dermatest p {margin-top: 2%;color:#555;font-size:1.5em;line-height:1.6}\r\n.dermatest p span {font-weight: 500;}\r\n\r\n/**제품사용방법**/\r\n.howtouse {padding: 5% 0 5%;margin-top:10%;background-color:#f4f4f4}\r\n.howtouse .title-sub-container h5::before{content:none;}\r\n.howtouse .title-sub-container h5{color:#1a1a1a;font-weight:600;background:none;}\r\n.howtouse .title-container h2{margin-top:0}\r\n.howtouse .sub-tit{text-align:right;width:92%;margin:3em 0 3em}\r\n.howtouse .sub-tit .label{display:inline-block;font-weight:500;font-size:2.5em;color:#333}\r\n.howtouse .sub-tit .label span{font-weight:100;font-size:0.7em;margin: 0 0.5em;position: relative;color:#666}\r\n.howtouse .sub-tit .label span:before{content:'''';width:1.5em;height:1px;background-color:#666;position:absolute;left:-2.2em;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)}\r\n\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 {text-align: center;position:relative;padding:0 10%;margin-bottom:9em;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01::after{clear:both;content:'''';display:block;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 .group-tit{font-size:2em;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:0.5em;border-radius:1.5em;min-width:13em;position:absolute;top:-1.2em;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01>ul{margin:7% 0 9%}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul::after{clear:both;content:'''';display:block;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li{float:left;width:20%;position:relative;text-align:center;vertical-align: top;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li .img-box{position:relative;margin:0 auto;padding:0 2em;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li .img-box:after{content: '''';background: url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/how-to-use-step-arrow02.png)no-repeat center center;\r\nbackground-size: contain;padding: 10px;position: absolute;top: 50%;right: -10px;transform: translateY(-50%);}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li:nth-child(5n+5) .img-box:after{content:none;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li .label{position:absolute;top:-0.8em;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);color:#fff;background-color:#333;border-radius: 1em;font-weight:500;padding:0.25em 1em;font-size:1.2em}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li .howtouse_c01_txt{margin-top:0.5em;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 ul li .howtouse_c01_txt p{font-size:1.7em;color:#4d453e;font-weight:600}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 .note .tit{font-size:2.0em;color:#4d453e;font-weight:600}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group01 .note .desc{font-size:1.7em;color:#666;font-weight:300;margin-top:0.3em;}\r\n\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 {text-align: center;position:relative;padding:0 2.5% 3%}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02::after{clear:both;content:'''';display:block;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 .group-tit{font-size:2em;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:0.5em;border-radius:1.5em;min-width:13em;position:absolute;top:-1.2em;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02>ul{margin:7% 0 0}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul::after{clear:both;content:'''';display:block;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul li{float:left;width:33%;position:relative;text-align:center;vertical-align: top;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul li .img-box{position:relative;margin:0 auto;padding:0 5em;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul li .img-box:after{content: '''';background: url(https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/how-to-use-step-arrow.png)no-repeat center center;\r\nbackground-size: contain;padding: 10px;position: absolute;top: 50%;right: -10px;transform: translateY(-50%);}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul li:nth-child(3n+3) .img-box:after{content:none;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul li .howtouse_c01_txt{margin-top:1em;}\r\n.howtouse .howtouse_contents_group02 ul li .howtouse_c01_txt p{font-size:1.7em;color:#4d453e;font-weight:400}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n/**이런 피부에 추천합니다**/\r\n.recommend {margin: 0 auto;padding: 7% 0;}\r\n.recommend .tit-label{font-size:28px;color:#0092bd;font-weight:600;}\r\n.product_detail_page .recommend h2{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:5%;letter-spacing: -3px;}\r\n.recommend_contents {width: 100%;padding:0 15%}\r\n.recommend_img, .recommend_main_text {vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;}\r\n.recommend_img {width: 15%;}\r\n.recommend_img img {width: 90%;}\r\n.recommend_check {width: 6%;}\r\n.recommend_main_text {text-align: left;background-color: #fbf8ef;\r\nwidth: 70%;padding: 4% 5%;margin-left: 3%;margin-right:1%;box-sizing: border-box;}\r\n.recommend_contents .bdb {width: 100%;border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec;margin: 1.5% 0;height:0;}\r\n.recommend_contents .pt {}\r\n.recommend_check, .recommend_text {display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;}\r\n.recommend_text {float:left;width: calc(100% - 3em);}\r\n.recommend_text p {font-weight: 300;font-size:1.5em;color:#333;}\r\n.recommend_text span {font-weight: 600;color: #333333;}\r\n.recommend_check img{width:25px;margin-top:2px;}\t\r\n.recommend_section::after{clear:both;content:'''';display:block;}\r\n.recommend_section .ico-check{float:left;width:1.5em;margin-top:0.4em;margin-right:0.5em;}\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"product_detail_page\">\n<div class=\"key_img\">\n<div class=\"key_box top\">\n<div class=\"key_tit\">\n<h1>케어셀라<br/>\r\n벨벳 커버 BB 크림</h1>\n<div class=\"sub-tit\">CareCella Velvet Cover BB Cream</div>\n<div class=\"tit-desc\">\n<div class=\"text1\">한번에 커버하는<br/>\r\n완벽한 피부완성</div>\n<div class=\"text2\">미백/주름개선/자외선차단</div>\n<div class=\"text3\">3 IN 1</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-01.jpg\"/></div>\n\n<div class=\"section point-featured clear\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>POINT</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2>케어셀라만의 기술력으로<br/>\n<span>장점을 극대화!</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"content-desc\">\n<div class=\"group1\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-02.jpg\"/>\n<ul class=\"label-text\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"text\">커버력</div>\n<span>POINT 1</span></li>\n<li><span>POINT2</span>\n<div class=\"text\">지속력</div>\n</li>\n<li><span>POINT3</span>\n<div class=\"text\">산뜻한 발림성</div>\n</li>\n<li><span>POINT4</span>\n<div class=\"text\">미백&amp;주름개선</div>\n</li>\n<li><span>POINT5</span>\n<div class=\"text\">자외선 차단효과</div>\n</li>\n<li><span>POINT6</span>\n<div class=\"text\">피부자극<br/>\r\n\t테스트완료</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"group2\">\n<div class=\"box-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-03.png\"/>\n<div class=\"text1\">제형 색상</div>\n<div class=\"text2\">내츄럴 베이지의 크림 타입</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section point01 clear\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>POINT 01</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2><span>피부 결점 커버는 물론 3중 기능으로<br/>\r\n고민을 한 번에 해결할 수 있는</span><br/>\r\n스킨케어 3 IN 1 BB크림</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"content-desc\">\n<ul class=\"group1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"tit\"><span>01.</span>자외선 차단 기능성<small>(SPF50+ /PA+++)</small></div>\n<ul class=\"desc\">\n<li><span>·</span>UVA와 UVB를 동시 차단하여 자외선으로부터 피부를 보호해 줍니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"tit\"><span>02.</span>미백 기능성</div>\n<ul class=\"desc\">\n<li><span>·</span>식약처 인증 기능성 성분인 알부틴이 함유되어 있습니다.</li>\n<li><span>·</span>기미, 주근깨 등을 효과적으로 케어해주고 맑고 투명한 피부 톤으로 가꾸어 줍니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"tit\"><span>03.</span>주름개선 기능성</div>\n<ul class=\"desc\">\n<li><span>·</span>식약처 인증 기능성 성분인 아데노신이 함유되어 있어 주름을 케어하고<br/>\r\n\t\t탄탄한 피부결로 가꾸어 줍니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section point02 clear\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>POINT 02</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2>피부 잡티 및 결점을<br/>\r\n완벽히 커버하여<br/>\n<span>자연스러운 피부 톤을 표현</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tit-desc\">\n<p>높은 밀착력으로 늘어나는 잡티까지,<br/>\r\n수많은 피부 결점을 빈틈없이<br/>\r\n커버하여 무결점 피부로 연출할 수 있습니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section point03 clear\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>POINT 03</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2><span>풍부한 영양 공급으로</span><br/>\r\n피부 속 촉촉하게 생기 충전</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tit-desc\">\n<p>충분한 영양과 수분을 공급하여 당기는 느낌 없이<br/>\r\n오랫동안 피부를 촉촉하게 유지해 줍니다. 유수분 밸런스를<br/>\r\n균형있게 유지시켜 오랫동안 무너짐 없이 지속되고<br/>\r\n번들거림 없는 피부로 유지해 줍니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section point04 clear\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>POINT 03</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2><span>산뜻한 발림성에</span><br/>\r\n오랜 지속력까지</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tit-desc\">\n<p>촉촉한 크림 타입의 텍스처로 인해, 산뜻한 발림성을<br/>\r\n갖고 있고, 오랜 시간 동안 답답함 없이 가벼운<br/>\r\n메이크업을 유지할 수 있습니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section main_ingredient\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>INGREDIENTS</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2><span>제품 </span>주요 성분</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ingredient01.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\"><span>아데노신</span></div>\n<p>주름을 개선해주는 식약처 기능성 허가 성분 중 하나이며,<br/>\r\n\t피부톤을 밝게하고 탄력있는 피부로 가꾸어 주는데 도움을 줍니다.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n\n<li>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\"><span>알부틴</span></div>\n<p>주로 월귤나무에서 추출하는 알부틴은 멜라닌 색소 침착을 방지하여<br/>\r\n\t미백 효과를 주며, 해로운 광선의 차단으로 피부 노화 뿐만 아니라<br/>\r\n\t기미 주근깨 등을 예방하는데 도움을 줍니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ingredient02.png\"/></div>\n</li>\n\n<li>\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ingredient03.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\"><span>알란토인</span></div>\n<p>주로 컴프리라는 식물에서 추출한 성분으로 거칠어진<br/>\r\n\t피부를 개선해주고, 매끄럽게 만들어 주며, 피부의 보습 기능을<br/>\r\n\t좋게 해주어 피부 장벽을 강화시켜 주는데 도움을 줍니다.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n\n<li>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\"><span>판테놀</span></div>\n<p>각질층의 수분 함유량을 높여주어 각질이나 가려움,<br/>\r\n\t붉은 기 등을 가라 앉혀 주는 진정효과를 줍니다</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ingredient04.png\"/></div>\n</li>\n\n<li>\n<div class=\"ingredient_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ingredient05.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"ingredient_txt\">\n<div class=\"ingredient_tit\"><span>캐모마일꽃추출물</span></div>\n<p>예민하고 민감한 피부를 진정시키고, 수분 증발을 차단해주어<br/>\r\n\t촉촉한 피부로 가꾸는데 도움을 줍니다.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fix_txt\">*상기 설명은 원료적 특성에 한함</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dermatest\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/dermatest.png\"/></div>\n<h3>독일 피부과학연구소</h3>\n<p>세계적인 독일 피부과학연구소 더마테스트(dermatest)에 24시간, 48시간, 72시간 인체 피부<br/>\r\n적용 실험을 의뢰<span>“피부자극없음”인 Excellent를 획득</span>하였습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"brand_story\">\n<div class=\"rounded\">BRAND STORY</div>\n<p class=\"point_tit\"><span>브랜드 </span>스토리</p>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/brand_story_carecella.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n<div class=\"brand_logo\"><img class=\"brand_img02\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/brand_story_cc_logo.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"bd\"> </div>\n<p>케어셀라는 <span>‘낫게하다’를 의미하는 Care</span>와 라틴어로 <span>세포를 의미하는 Cella</span>의 합성어로 피부 본연의 아름다움을 찾아주는 시작점을 뜻합니다.</p>\n<p>자연에서 찾은 식물성 원료를 사용하여 각 피부에 맞는 제품을 개발하고 전문적인 케어 가이드를 제안하는 <span>홈 뷰티 화장품 브랜드</span>입니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"howtouse\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>HOW TO TUSE</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2><span>제품 </span>사용 순서</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_contents_group01\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\">\n<div class=\"label\">STEP 1</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0101.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>하이드레이션<br/>\r\n\t폼 클렌저</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\">\n<div class=\"label\">STEP 2</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0102.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>하이드레이션<br/>\r\n\t밸런스 토너</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\">\n<div class=\"label\">STEP 3</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0103.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>하이드레이션<br/>\r\n\t인센티브 세럼</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\">\n<div class=\"label\">STEP 4</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0104.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>하이드레이션<br/>\r\n\t딥 에멀젼</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\">\n<div class=\"label\">STEP 5</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0105.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>케어셀라 벨벳 커버<br/>\r\n\t비비 크림</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"note\">\n<div class=\"tit\">※ 건성피부의 경우</div>\n<div class=\"desc\">기초 손질 단계에서 딥 에멀젼을 바른 후 아쿠아 크림을 도포 후에 BB크림을 발라 줍니다.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"howtouse_contents_group02\">\n<div class=\"title-sub-container\">\n<h5>DIRECTIONS</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2><span>제품 </span>사용 방법</h2>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0201.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>기초 손질의 마지막 단계에<br/>\r\n\t적당량을 취해 피부 결을 따라<br/>\r\n\t얼굴 전체에 고루 펴 바릅니다.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0202.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>특히, 햇볕에 장시간 노출이<br/>\r\n\t많은 이마, 콧등, 광대뼈 등의<br/>\r\n\t부위는 두드리듯 꼼꼼히 바릅니다.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"howtouse_content01\">\n<div class=\"img-box\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-how-to-step-0203.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"howtouse_c01_txt\">\n<p>펴 바를 때 눈에 들어가지<br/>\r\n\t않도록 주의하고, 제품 사용 후에는<br/>\r\n\t튜브의 입구를 깨끗이 닦은 후<br/>\r\n\t캡으로 완전히 밀폐하여<br/>\r\n\t실온에서 보관하십시오.</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"recommend\">\n<div class=\"title-container\">\n<h2>이런 피부에 <span>추천합니다.</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"recommend_contents\">\n<div class=\"recommend_img\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/carecella-velvet-cover-bb-cream-07.jpg\"/></div>\n<div class=\"recommend_main_text\">\n<div class=\"recommend_section\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ico-check\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ico-circle-check.png\"/>\n<div class=\"recommend_text\">\n<p>두껍지 않은 <span>얇고 밀착되는 사용감</span>을 원하시는 분</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bdb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"recommend_section\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ico-check\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ico-circle-check.png\"/>\n<div class=\"recommend_text\">\n<p><span>커버력이 좋은 베이스 제품</span>을 찾으시는 분</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bdb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"recommend_section\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ico-check\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ico-circle-check.png\"/>\n<div class=\"recommend_text\">\n<p>수정 화장 없이 <span>오랜 지속력</span>을 원하시는 분</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bdb\"> </div>\n<div class=\"recommend_section\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ico-check\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/carecella_velvet_cover_bb_cream/v10/ico-circle-check.png\"/>\n<div class=\"recommend_text\">\n<p><span>산뜻한 BB크림의 사용감</span>을 원하시는 분</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"certifications\">\n<div class=\"certifi_info_tit\">\n<div class=\"certifi_info_subject\">\n<h2><span class=\"light\">각종 </span>인증 사항<br/>\n<span class=\"sm-text\">CERTIFICATIONS</span></h2>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifications.png\"/></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"certifi_info_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifi_B_corp.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"certifi_01_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_Detail\">\n<h5>비코프인증 획득!</h5>\n<h6><span>비코프인증(B-Corp Certified)</span>이란?</h6>\n<p>B-Corp은 비즈니스를 통해 사회 환경적 문제를 해결하고 사회에 긍정적인 영향을 끼치는 기업을 확대하기 위해서 2007년 BLab (미국비영리 조직)이 만든 글로벌 사회적 기업 인증 제도입니다</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"certifi_01\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifi_iso22716.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"certifi_01_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_Detail\">\n<h5>국제 화장품 규격(CosmeticsGMP)ISO22716인증 획득!</h5>\n<h6><span>ISO 22716</span>이란?</h6>\n<p>CosmeticsGMP(GoodManufacturingPractices)화장품 우수제조관리기준입니다.화장품 기업의 제조 시설관리 기준(GMP)뿐만 아니라, 제품 안전성 관리 시스템(업무체계)의 실행 및 유지가 매우 중요한 평가 요소입니다.품질 및 안전이 보증된 화장품을 제조하기 위한 제품, 시설 및 공정 기준을 제시합니다.총 17개의 요구 사항으로 이루어져 있으며,이 요구 사항들은 인적자원,건물,장비 등의 인프라 관리를 기반으로 원재료에서 완제품까지의 제조 관리 기준을 통과해야만 받을 수 있는 인증입니다</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"certifi_01\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifi_cgmp.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"certifi_01_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_Detail\">\n<h5>CGMP(우수화장품 제조기준)인증 획득!</h5>\n<h6><span>CGMP 인증</span>이란?</h6>\n<p>CGMP규정의 목표는 소비자에게 신뢰받는 안전하고 우수한 품질의 제품을 제조하기 위하여 작업장의 구조,설비를 비롯하여 원료의 구입으로부터 생산,포장,출하에 이르기까지의 전 공정에 걸쳐 생산과 품질의 관리에 대한 체계적인 기준으로 평가해 모든 단계를 표준화된 기준에 따라 체계적으로 관리해 제품의 품질보증을 달성하는 기업에게 주는 인증입니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"certifi_01\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_img\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn3.gcooperp.com/storage/global_image/common_img/certifi_family.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"certifi_01_content\">\n<div class=\"certifi_01_Detail\">\n<h5>가족친화우수기업 인증 획득!</h5>\n<h6><span>가족친화인증</span>이란?</h6>\n<p>가족친화제도를 모범적으로 운영하는 기업 및 공공기관에 대하여 심사를 통해 인증을 부여하는 제도입니다.가족친화인증 기업은 근로자가 일에 집중하도록 하여 기업 생산성과 경쟁력 강화하고 출산율 제고,고용 안정 등으로 국가경제 발전에 기여할 뿐 아니라 가족친화경영 확산을 통한 근로자와 가족 구성원의 삶의 질을 향상시키는 바른 기업 문화를 확산 시킵니다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://vcshop.gcoop.com/images/icon_edu_materials.png\" style=\"width:220px;\"/></a>\n</div>\n</div>","info":[["품명","케어셀라 벨벳 커버 비비크림"],["용량","50mL"],["사용기간","제조일로부터 24개월"],["사용방법","1. 기초 손질의 마지막 단계에 적량을 취해 피부 결을 따라 얼굴 전체에 고루 펴 바릅니다.\n2. 특히, 햇볕에 장시간 노출이 많은 이마, 콧등, 광대뼈 등의 부위는 두드리듯 꼼꼼히 바릅니다.\n3. 펴 바를 때 눈에 들어가지 않도록 주의하고, 제품 사용 후에는 튜브의 입구를 깨끗이 닦은 후 캡으로 완전히 밀폐하여 실온에서 보관하십시오"],["화장품 제조업자 및 화장품 책임 판매 업자","화장품 제조업자 : 하나코스(주) /\n화장품 책임 판매업자 : 제너럴바이오(주)"],["제조국","대한민국"],["전성분","정제수, 사이클로펜타실록세인, 티타늄디옥사이드, 에칠헥실메톡시신나메이트, 징크옥사이드, 부틸렌글라이콜, 세틸피이지/피피지-10/1다이메티콘, 에틸헥실팔미테이트, 솔비탄세스퀴올리에이트, 카프릴릭/카프릭트라이글리세라이드, 알부틴, 다이메티콘, 다이프로필렌글라이콜, 황색산화철, 소듐클로라이드, 1,2-헥산다이올, 비즈왁스, 다이스테아다이모늄헥토라이트, 마그네슘알루미늄실리케이트, 적색산화철, 하이드록시아세토페논, 다이메티콘/비닐다이메티콘크로스폴리머, 흑색산화철, 피이지-10다이메티콘크로스폴리머, 오조케라이트, 알루미늄하이드록사이드, 트라이에톡시카프릴릴실레인, 라벤더오일, 리날룰, 아데노신, 알란토인, 판테놀, 마트리카리아꽃추출물, 겐티아나뿌리추출물, 쓴쑥추출물, 쇠비름추출물, 설탕단풍추출물, 카프릴릴글라이콜"],["pH","7.3\n± 1.0"],["기능성","미백, 주름개선, 자외선차단(SPF50+ /PA+++)기능성 화장품"],["주의사항","1. 화장품 사용 시 또는 사용 후 직사광선에 의하여 사용부위가 붉은 반점\n,\n부어오름 또는 가려움증 등의 이상 증상이나 부작용이 있는 경우 전문의 등과 상담할 것\n2.\n상처가 있는 부위 등에는 사용을 자제할 것\n3.  보관 및 취급 시의 주의사항\n가. 어린이의 손이 닿지 않는 곳에 보관할 것\n나. 직사광선을 피해서 보관할 것\n4. 알부틴은\n\"\n인체적용시험자료\n\"\n에서 구진과 경미한 가려움이 보고된 예가 있음"],["품질보증기준","본 상품의 품질보증 및 피해보상에 관한 사항은 관련 법률 및 공정거래위원회 고시 [소비자분쟁해결기준]에 따릅니다."],["소비자 상담관련 전화번호","[\n소비자상담실] 02-555-6009\n지쿱 홈페이지(\nwww.gcoop.com)하단\n소비자상담센터 이용"]]}